## Scope / 适用范围

**MIT applies to code only** — the site's styles, client scripts and page
templates under `assets/`:

- midicn/theo : site pages (HTML), styles (CSS), client scripts (JavaScript)

**The text content of every page** (headings, summaries, article bodies,
diagram captions — both Chinese and English) is **original writing** licensed
under **CC BY 4.0** — attribution only:

    midicn 乐理与和声 © 2026 midicn contributors, licensed CC BY 4.0
    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

The content source lives in [`midicn/music-theory`](https://github.com/midicn/music-theory);
see its `LICENSE` for the full content-licence text.

**Musical material is NOT relicensed here.** Every track referenced by a page
keeps the licence of its upstream source (see the per-track `l` field in the
[dataset](https://lib.midicn.com/)). This project claims no rights over that
material and cannot grant rights to it.
